// fixture-255: S4 (#159) — partial profile, positive predicate over absent axis → dep excluded
//
// A partial profile has MILPA_TARGET_PLATFORM=linux but NO MILPA_TARGET_ARCH.
// Member `member-a` declares a dep `archlib` gated on `when arch="amd64"`.
//
// Since `arch` is absent (the axis is None in the partial profile), the
// predicate is indeterminate ⇒ excluded (resolver-semantics §3.C / §6).
//
// This is the positive-predicate case of the absent-axis rule (#159).
// The negated-predicate case is in fixture-256.
workspace {
    member "member-a"
}
